 "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 10, "seek": 2900, "start": 32.0, "end": 35.0, "text": " \u00bfHa notado mejor\u00eda? \u00bfHa ido a peor o est\u00e1 igual?", "tokens": [50514, 3841, 23745, 406, 1573, 11479, 2686, 30, 3841, 23745, 47771, 257, 520, 284, 277, 3192, 10953, 30, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07912421635219029, "compression_ratio": 1.5903225806451613, "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 11, "seek": 2900, "start": 35.0, "end": 37.0, "text": " Sigue igual, no ha cambiado.", "tokens": [50664, 318, 16831, 10953, 11, 572, 324, 19569, 1573, 13, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07912421635219029, "compression_ratio": 1.5903225806451613, "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 12, "seek": 2900, "start": 37.0, "end": 39.0, "text": " \u00bfLe hab\u00eda aplazado esto alguna vez antes?", "tokens": [50764, 3841, 11020, 16395, 25522, 921, 1573, 7433, 20651, 5715, 11014, 30, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07912421635219029, "compression_ratio": 1.5903225806451613, "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 13, "seek": 2900, "start": 39.0, "end": 41.0, "text": " No, nunca.", "tokens": [50864, 883, 11, 13768, 13, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07912421635219029, "compression_ratio": 1.5903225806451613, "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 14, "seek": 2900, "start": 41.0, "end": 45.0, "text": " Vamos a revisar s\u00edntomas. \u00bfLe cuesta cerrar el ojo o nota que se le cae la baba?", "tokens": [50964, 10894, 257, 20767, 289, 8600, 580, 7092, 13, 3841, 11020, 2702, 7841, 10146, 5352, 806, 277, 5134, 277, 36192, 631, 369, 476, 1335, 68, 635, 31568, 30, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07912421635219029, "compression_ratio": 1.5903225806451613, "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 15, "seek": 2900, "start": 45.0, "end": 49.0, "text": " El ojo no me cierra bien y s\u00ed, se me escapa un poco la saliva.", "tokens": [51164, 2699, 277, 5134, 572, 385, 269, 17452, 3610, 288, 8600, 11, 369, 385, 12663, 4306, 517, 10639, 635, 43540, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07912421635219029, "compression_ratio": 1.5903225806451613, "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 16, "seek": 2900, "start": 49.0, "end": 51.0, "text": " \u00bfNota cambios en el gusto o el ojo seco?", "tokens": [51364, 3841, 15208, 64, 18751, 2717, 465, 806, 38723, 277, 806, 277, 5134, 907, 78, 30, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07912421635219029, "compression_ratio": 1.5903225806451613, "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 17, "seek": 2900, "start": 51.0, "end": 54.0, "text": " La comida me sabe rara y el ojo me pica de seco.", "tokens": [51464, 2369, 30779, 385, 12275, 367, 2419, 288, 806, 277, 5134, 385, 280, 2262, 368, 907, 78, 13, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07912421635219029, "compression_ratio": 1.5903225806451613, "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 18, "seek": 2900, "start": 54.0, "end": 57.0, "text": " D\u00edgame si tiene dolor detr\u00e1s de la oreja o dolor de cabeza.", "tokens": [51614, 413, 870, 15038, 1511, 7066, 42416, 1141, 17168, 368, 635, 20865, 2938, 277, 42416, 368, 34615, 13, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07912421635219029, "compression_ratio": 1.5903225806451613, "no_speech_prob": 0.04200442507863045}, {"id": 19, "seek": 5700, "start": 57.0, "end": 59.0, "text": " S\u00ed, dolor detr\u00e1s de la oreja tengo.", "tokens": [50364, 12375, 11, 42416, 1141, 17168, 368, 635, 20865, 2938, 13989, 13, 50464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 20, "seek": 5700, "start": 59.0, "end": 63.0, "text": " Sobre el o\u00eddo. \u00bfOye menos, ti\u00f1a zumbidos o se marea?", "tokens": [50464, 407, 2672, 806, 277, 28470, 13, 3841, 46, 1200, 8902, 11, 8757, 12150, 710, 2860, 7895, 277, 369, 463, 12057, 30, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 21, "seek": 5700, "start": 63.0, "end": 66.0, "text": " Oigo un pitido y estoy un poco mareado, pero oigo bien.", "tokens": [50664, 422, 7483, 517, 10147, 2925, 288, 15796, 517, 10639, 31471, 1573, 11, 4768, 277, 7483, 3610, 13, 50814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 22, "seek": 5700, "start": 66.0, "end": 68.0, "text": " \u00bfLe molestan los ruidos fuertes?", "tokens": [50814, 3841, 11020, 8015, 377, 282, 1750, 5420, 7895, 8536, 911, 279, 30, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 23, "seek": 5700, "start": 68.0, "end": 70.0, "text": " S\u00ed, bastante.", "tokens": [50914, 12375, 11, 14651, 13, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 24, "seek": 5700, "start": 70.0, "end": 72.0, "text": " Importante para descartar la gravedad.", "tokens": [51014, 26391, 2879, 1690, 7471, 446, 289, 635, 1295, 937, 345, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 25, "seek": 5700, "start": 72.0, "end": 75.0, "text": " \u00bfTiene fuerza en brazos y piernas? Lev\u00e1ntelos.", "tokens": [51114, 3841, 51, 10174, 39730, 465, 1548, 27681, 288, 9766, 18979, 30, 28471, 27525, 338, 329, 13, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 26, "seek": 5700, "start": 75.0, "end": 77.0, "text": " S\u00ed, tengo fuerza.", "tokens": [51264, 12375, 11, 13989, 39730, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 27, "seek": 5700, "start": 77.0, "end": 79.0, "text": " \u00bfLe cuesta tragar comida o le cuesta hablar?", "tokens": [51364, 3841, 11020, 2702, 7841, 944, 2976, 30779, 277, 476, 2702, 7841, 21014, 30, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 28, "seek": 5700, "start": 79.0, "end": 82.0, "text": " Tragar no, pero hablar s\u00ed, vocalizo mal.", "tokens": [51464, 314, 3731, 289, 572, 11, 4768, 21014, 8600, 11, 11657, 19055, 2806, 13, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 29, "seek": 5700, "start": 82.0, "end": 84.0, "text": " \u00bfCamina bien, ve doble?", "tokens": [51614, 3841, 31030, 1426, 3610, 11, 1241, 360, 638, 30, 51714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 30, "seek": 5700, "start": 84.0, "end": 86.0, "text": " Camino bien y veo bien.", "tokens": [51714, 6886, 2982, 3610, 288, 41319, 3610, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10430516329678623, "compression_ratio": 1.5842293906810037, "no_speech_prob": 0.14832106232643127}, {"id": 31, "seek": 8600, "start": 86.0, "end": 90.0, "text": " Sobre las causas, \u00bfha tenido fiebre o malestar general tipo gripe estos d\u00edas?", "tokens": [50364, 407, 2672, 2439, 3302, 296, 11, 3841, 1641, 33104, 283, 414, 2672, 277, 2806, 39791, 2674, 9746, 17865, 494, 12585, 19527, 30, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06663519219507145, "compression_ratio": 1.605095541401274, "no_speech_prob": 0.009991122409701347}, {"id": 32, "seek": 8600, "start": 90.0, "end": 92.0, "text": " No, nada de fiebre.", "tokens": [50564, 883, 11, 8096, 368, 283, 414, 2672, 13, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06663519219507145, "compression_ratio": 1.605095541401274, "no_speech_prob": 0.009991122409701347}, {"id": 33, "seek": 8600, "start": 92.0, "end": 96.0, "text": " Aparte del aire, \u00bfha tenido mucho estr\u00e9s, alg\u00fan golpe o o\u00eddo al dentista hace poco?", "tokens": [50664, 24111, 68, 1103, 42885, 11, 3841, 1641, 33104, 9824, 871, 18981, 11, 26300, 42032, 277, 277, 28470, 419, 7059, 5236, 10032, 10639, 30, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06663519219507145, "compression_ratio": 1.605095541401274, "no_speech_prob": 0.009991122409701347}, {"id": 34, "seek": 8600, "start": 96.0, "end": 99.0, "text": " Estr\u00e9s s\u00ed, mucho tr\u00e1fico. Golpes y dentista no.", "tokens": [50864, 4410, 18981, 8600, 11, 9824, 504, 23858, 78, 13, 36319, 5190, 288, 7059, 5236, 572, 13, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06663519219507145, "compression_ratio": 1.605095541401274, "no_speech_prob": 0.009991122409701347}, {"id": 35, "seek": 8600, "start": 99.0, "end": 102.0, "text": " \u00bfC\u00f3mo le afecta esto para trabajar con el taxi?", "tokens": [51014, 3841, 28342, 476, 30626, 64, 7433, 1690, 30793, 416, 806, 18984, 30, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06663519219507145, "compression_ratio": 1.605095541401274, "no_speech_prob": 0.009991122409701347}, {"id": 36, "seek": 8600, "start": 102.0, "end": 105.0, "text": " Pues imag\u00ednense, no puedo trabajar as\u00ed de cara al p\u00fablico.", "tokens": [51164, 22386, 2576, 10973, 1288, 11, 572, 21612, 30793, 8582, 368, 10962, 419, 26557, 13, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06663519219507145, "compression_ratio": 1.605095541401274, "no_speech_prob": 0.009991122409701347}, {"id": 37, "seek": 8600, "start": 105.0, "end": 108.0, "text": " Para terminar, \u00bfalg\u00fan familiar ha tenido paralisis facial?", "tokens": [51314, 11107, 36246, 11, 3841, 20422, 9453, 4963, 324, 33104, 26009, 28436, 15642, 30, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0666351921